    {"[color=#8c0000]▀▄▄[color=#383838]▀[/color] █[/color] [color=#383838]▀█[/color] [color=#AAAAAA]Marine High Command | [italic]2nd Battalion, 3rd Regiment[/italic][/color]   [color=#dfc189]✯  ✯[/color]"}

    {"[color=#383838]▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄[/color]"}
    {"[color=#8c0000]▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀[/color]"}

    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]SECTOR ENFORCEMENT CENTER - FORT THUNDER, TRAPPIST-5[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Engagement Protocol - Fiorina Science Annex AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-SE"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"The Fiorina Annex has violated Joint Security Order 9."}

    {"Communications are down, and we have reason to believe Weston-Yamada has lost control of its own experiments."}

    {"You are to secure the site with overwhelming force and terminate all rogue assets."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Fortify a Forward Operating Base adjacent to the Lower Industrial Block."}
    {"[bullet]Sweep the facility's prison tiers, medlabs, and freight elevator junctions for hostile elements."}
    {"[bullet]Confiscate or destroy all Weston-Yamada biological and classified equipment."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Execute crowd control protocols in inmate holding areas. Non-compliant prisoners are not to be released."}
    {"[bullet]Seal shuttle hangar and deny all escape attempts by corporate or compromised subjects."}
    {"[bullet]Eliminate anomalous biological formations near the science wing containment zones."}

    {"[underline]Minimal patience. Maximum pressure.[/underline]"}
    {"The Corps does not recognize private interference in secure combat zones."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Colonel Margaret A.W. Shanks[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]United Nations Marine Corps | Colonial Protection Organization - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]No mercy. No doubt.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
