    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]PROVOST MARSHAL'S FIELD OFFICE - NEW MASON COLONY, 61 CYGNI SYSTEM[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Deployment Priorities - Fiorina Science Annex AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-HM"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"The Fiorina Annex is both prison and proving ground."}

    {"It is a site with human lives at its center, many of them forgotten and uncared for."}

    {"WY and UA oversight may be fragmented, but your orders are not: [underline]prioritize preservation, justice, and restraint.[/underline]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Deploy your FOB at a location where aid and triage can be delivered to both staff and inmate survivors."}
    {"[bullet]Locate missing medical teams and security personnel last seen near the transit hub."}
    {"[bullet]Secure ethically questionable research logs and bring evidence of abuse or violations to the Almayer."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Avoid lethal force in prison areas unless direct threat is confirmed."}
    {"[bullet]Facilitate safe evacuation of non-hostile prisoners through upper docking platforms."}
    {"[bullet]Preserve biological storage and archive blocks for forensic review."}

    {"Human dignity persists even in places left behind."}
    {"Show Fiorina what the Corps stands for."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Colonel Adrian Blackburn[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]UNMC Provost Marshal | Hearts & Minds Movement - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]In service to justice and peace.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
