    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]TECHNICAL OPERATIONS DIRECTORATE - ANVIL STATION, HERCULINA ORBIT[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Research-Oriented Objectives - Fiorina Science Annex AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-RI"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"The Fiorina Annex was host to dual-research protocols: behavioral modification of inmate populations and bioweapon experimentation."}

    {"We need to know what survived the collapse."}

    {"Proceed as an asset recovery expedition."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Secure FOB at a location that will offer direct access to the Botany Wing and Cryo Storage."}
    {"[bullet]Recover research data, subject samples, and neurological implants from terminated projects in the main lab."}
    {"[bullet]Identify and quarantine anomalous biological strains or unknown entities within the prison's boundaries."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Preserve AI logs and camera footage from the Warden's office."}
    {"[bullet]Monitor potential biological movement via trail sensors in the prison chapel and autopsy theater."}
    {"[bullet]Extract unfinished prototypes or unauthorized drug batches stored near LZ1 medstorage."}

    {"[underline]You are not here to destroy everything.[/underline]"}
    {"You are here to learn what we'd rather not forget."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Lt. Colonel Geoffrey Lamdem[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]Division Logistics Commander | Military Organization for Development and Innovation - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]Onward through progress.[/italic][/color]"}

